{title: Dilbar Dilbar}
{artist: Alka Yagnik Neha Kakkar Dhvani Bhanushali}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Dilbar dilbar,        [Am]Chadha jo [Dm]mujhpe [Am]suroor hai
[Am]Asar te [Dm]ra yeh [Am]zaroor hai,        [Dm]Teri nazar ka [Am]kasoor hai
[Am]Dilbar dilbar,        [Am]Aa paas [Dm]aa tu kyun [Am]door hai
[Am]Yeh ishq [Dm]ka jo [Am]fitoor hai,        [Dm]Nashe mein dil tere [Am]choor hai
[Am]Dilbar dilbar,        Ab toh [Am]hosh na [G]khabar hai
Yeh [Am]kaisa [G]asar hai,        [Am]Hosh na [G]khabar hai
[Am]Yeh kaisa [G]asar hai,        [F]Tumse milne [G]ke baad [Am]dilbar
[G]Tumse milne ke baad [Am]dilbar,        [Am]Dilbar dilbar [G]dilbar dilbar?
[Am]Dilbar dilbar [G]dilbar dilbar?        [Am]Karti qatal na aise tu chal
Paheli [F]ka iss nikalo koi hal,        Husan ka pitara [Am]khilta kamal
Kar lunga [F]sabar kyuki mitha hai phal,        Tu [Am]mera khaab [G]hai
Tu [F]mere [G]dil ka qara [Am]ar,        Dekh le [Am]jaan-e- [G]mann
Dekh [F]le [G]bas ek [Am]baar,        [Am]Chain kho gaya hai
[Am]Kuch toh ho gaya hai,        [Am]Chain kho gaya [G]hai
[Am]Kuch toh ho gaya hai,        [F]Tumse milne [G]ke baad [Am]dilbar
[G]Tumse milne ke baad [Am]dilbar,        Ladies?
Ab toh [Am]hosh na [G]khabar hai,        Yeh [Am]kaisa [G]asar hai
[Am]Hosh na [G]khabar hai,        [Am]Yeh kaisa [G]asar hai
[F]Tumse milne [G]ke baad [Am]dilbar,        [G]Tumse milne ke baad [Am]dilbar
